<title>CANADA: Canadian West Coast Vessel Loadings - CWB.</title>
<headline>Canadian West Coast Vessel Loadings - CWB.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board reported five ships loading, 11 waiting and nine due at the Canadian West Coast, as of Monday.</p>
<p>The longest wait to load on the West Coast was 18 days. Three ships loaded in Thunder Bay and 14 were due. One ship loaded on the East Coast, three waited and 18 were due.</p>
<p>    Port	 Loading	Waiting</p>
<p>    Vancouver	 4	     9</p>
<p>    Prince Rupert   1	     2</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
